# .github/release-sync-ignore — T-5 release fulfilment scope for this repository.
#
# Read by release-sync and by check-release-drift.sh, always from the DEFAULT BRANCH.
# Exact tag names, one per line; no globs; `#` lines are comments.
#
# This repository starts its public history at v0.1.0 (fresh history, one initial import).
# Nothing is exempt. Do not add tags here to skip a Release — the way to ship without a
# Release is to not push a v* tag.
